<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\昼の月.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "358" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "50"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―Shiyo 790, April 17. About 10 years ago now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We were right in the middle of getting ready to move from Megasawa to Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE> had brought me to the Arata settlement to let <STYLE ID="2">Grandma</STYLE> know we were moving to Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>'s third-year memorial service had brought us there just 10 days before. [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, hello. How is the injury on your head?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"S-</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">H-h-hello..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE> smiled like the Goddess and gently <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="な">stroked</STYLE> my head.<PG>
Whenever I looked into <STYLE ID="4">this woman</STYLE>'s eyes, I felt my heart ease, just like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was exactly the Goddess I pictured.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh? </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you seem livelier than before. Did something good happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Ehehe, we get to live in Motoki-cho again!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"That's the town with all those cherry trees, isn't it? If you live there, I think you'll become even livelier than you are now."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, are you feeling all right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. Yes, I'm much better now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Maybe that's the end of it for this year?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE> been sick or something...?<PG>
Speaking of being sick―<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A girl's voice from overhead.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\新村家桜昼.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱子供.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When I craned my neck to look up, Chiga-nee was waving at me from up in the cherry tree.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Then <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> jumped down from the tree without hesitating.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家庭.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Ahaha! </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! Are you all better now!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... I'm all better now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had been out sick for the last memorial service, so I hadn't gotten to see her.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, that hairstyle looks really good on you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ehehe, thanks!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> reached out to pat my head.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ah, ow!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... sorry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't remember it well now, but I didn't really want to talk about why my head was hurt.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... did you hurt your head?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah... a little... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Oh, I'm going to go check on </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I went into the house like I was running away.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜赤ちゃん.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you were watching </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! I wanna babysit too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then that's perfect. Watch </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> for me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Okay. Are you going to do something?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and I need to talk, just the two of us. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... when she gets back, could you tell her to come upstairs?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Okay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and I are going to talk upstairs, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, don't come up, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"............? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Okay."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE> headed upstairs.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm-ma. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Mm-ma!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Wow, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, amaaazing! You can crawl now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the memorial service she could only roll over, but in these 10 days she'd learned to move around on <STYLE ID="9">her own</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"My, my, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. Moving around all over the place, what a little tomboy you are. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">When you grow up, will you be able to run through the Arata mountains faster than anyone?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="11"> came into the living room too, watching </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE> with gentle eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Trying to make my eyes gentle too, I gazed at <STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"She's </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s baby, so she'll grow up healthy and good for sure!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes. I'd be so happy if she turned out lively and cheerful like you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just being praised like that by <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE> used to make me warm inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was like the sun of the Arata settlement.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"By the way, where's </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"She went upstairs. She said she's gonna talk with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> when she gets back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I just remembered something I need to do, so would you watch </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> for a little while?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Okay! I'll play with </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm-ma! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">　Mm-ma!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n200\r\n2000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n11\r\n0\r\n2000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n200\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE> tried to follow <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE> out of the living room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"No, no, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you have to wait here, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't know how to hold a baby, so I had no idea how to stop <STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For the time being, I decided to follow her and keep a close eye on her.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜赤ちゃん逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm-ma-ma?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, that way's the front door. Your </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s inside the house!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"I'm home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Welcome home, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, babysitting </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">? Good for you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ehehe! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> said she's waiting for you upstairs."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Your mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> is? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　I see."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh... welcome back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh? Didn't you go upstairs?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, I thought I'd come greet </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, you have something to tell me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, could I ask you to come upstairs for a moment? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, look after </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> for me."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm-ma-ma-ma!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜赤ちゃん逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm-maa."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Your mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> doesn't seem to be back yet."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Mm-maa!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">Kana</STYLE> went on <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="は">crawling</STYLE> all over the place after that, and finally made her way toward the veranda.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "358" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "50"}
