<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, what's wrong? Aren't you feeling well?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there was no answer.
{PAUSE ""}
