<STYLE ID="4">"Aah...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Uwaah...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE>'s face was <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="そうはく">deathly pale</STYLE>, and her body was in the grip of an abnormal amount of cold sweat and trembling.
